# 🧠 Interview Rule #1

Before writing SQL, ask:

```text
What am I trying to find?
```

Most SQL questions fall into one of these buckets:

| Goal              | SQL Tool          |
| ----------------- | ----------------- |
| Filter rows       | WHERE             |
| Group data        | GROUP BY          |
| Connect tables    | JOIN              |
| Compare rows      | Window Functions  |
| Find rankings     | ROW_NUMBER / RANK |
| Find missing data | LEFT JOIN + NULL  |

