# Challenge 4: Find Customers With No Orders

---

## Thinking

Question contains:

```text
No Orders
```

Huge clue.

---

## Pattern

```text
Missing Match
```

Use:

```text
LEFT JOIN + NULL
```

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT c.*
FROM customers c
LEFT JOIN orders o
ON c.id = o.customer_id
WHERE o.customer_id IS NULL;
```

---

## Why It Works

LEFT JOIN keeps all customers.

Customers without orders get:

```text
NULL
```

Filter those rows.

